### ============================
### SETUP: Check initial inventory
### ============================

### Get current inventory state (item-1: 100, item-2: 50, item-3: 0)
GET http://localhost:8081/inventory
Accept: application/json

### ============================
### UC1 - Happy Path (Successful Order)
### ============================

### 1. Place order - sufficient stock (expect 202)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-001",
  "itemId": "item-1",
  "quantity": 10
}

###

### 2. Check order status (wait 2-3s, expect PROCESSED)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/order-001/status
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Verify inventory reduced (item-1 should be 90)
GET http://localhost:8081/inventory
Accept: application/json

### ============================
### UC2 - Invalid Payload (Validation)
### ============================

### 1. Empty orderId (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "",
  "itemId": "item-1",
  "quantity": 10
}

###

### 2. Negative quantity (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-002",
  "itemId": "item-1",
  "quantity": -1
}

###

### 3. Empty itemId (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-002",
  "itemId": "",
  "quantity": 10
}

### ============================
### UC3 - Insufficient Stock
### ============================

### 1. Place order - item-3 has 0 stock (expect 202)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-003",
  "itemId": "item-3",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### 2. Check order status (wait 2-3s, expect REJECTED)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/order-003/status
Accept: application/json

### ============================
### UC4 - Item Not Found
### ============================

### 1. Place order - item-999 does not exist (expect 202)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-004",
  "itemId": "item-999",
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### 2. Check order status (wait 2-3s, expect REJECTED)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/order-004/status
Accept: application/json

### ============================
### UC5 - Idempotency (Duplicate Order)
### ============================

### 1. Place original order (expect 202)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-005",
  "itemId": "item-2",
  "quantity": 5
}

###

### 2. Check order status (wait 2-3s, expect PROCESSED)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/order-005/status
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Resend same orderId - identical params (expect 409 - duplicate order)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-005",
  "itemId": "item-2",
  "quantity": 5
}

###

### 4. Resend same orderId - different params (expect 409 - duplicate order)
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-005",
  "itemId": "item-2",
  "quantity": 999
}

###

### 5. Check order status (expect PROCESSED - status unchanged)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/order-005/status
Accept: application/json

### ============================
### UC6 - Order Not Found
### ============================

### 1. Check status - non existent order (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/order-999/status
Accept: application/json